settings.AllowNPCDetection.name = Visible to NPCs
settings.AllowNPCDetection.description = When enabled, NPCs can detect and react to you while in Creative mode
settings.RespondToHit.name = Respond To Hit
settings.RespondToHit.description = When enabled, you can receive knockback and other hit effects while invincible in Creative mode
settings.BrushShapeRendering.name = Brush Block Rendering
settings.BrushShapeRendering.description = Toggles the brush preview render between wireframe and block style
settings.FlightSpeedMultiplier.description = Adjust flight and movement speed
settings.BrushSoundVolume.description = Adjust the volume of brush tool sound effects
settings.HideHud.description = Hide all HUD elements
settings.HideHotbar.description = Hide the hotbar while in Creative mode
settings.HideCompass.description = Hide the compass while in Creative mode
settings.HideNotifications.description = Hide notifications while in Creative mode
settings.HideChat.description = Hide the chat window while in Creative mode
settings.HideHeldItem.description = Hide the item in your hand while in Creative mode
settings.ShowEntityMarkers.description = Show entity markers while in Creative mode
settings.CreativeInteractionDistance.name = Block Place Distance
settings.CreativeInteractionDistance.description = Controls the maximum distance you can place a block in Creative mode.
settings.AirPlacement.name = Air Placing
settings.AirPlacement.description = Allows you to place blocks in the air. Use the mouse scroll wheel to increase/decrease place distance.
settings.FreePlace.name = Free Place
settings.FreePlace.description = Allows you to freely place blocks in any direction. Best used while placing blocks rapidly.
settings.NoPhysics.name = No Physics
settings.NoPhysics.description = Allows you to disable block physics and lets you place any block anywhere.
settings.HighlightBlockTarget.name = Highlight Block Target
settings.HighlightBlockTarget.description = Highlight the block you are looking at.
settings.QuickReplace.name = Replace
settings.QuickReplace.description = Replaces the block you are looking at with the one you are holding.
settings.QuickRetype.name = Retype
settings.QuickRetype.description = Replaces the material of the block you are looking at with the one you are holding, but keeps the shape/variant of the block you are looking at.
settings.Extrude.name = Extrude
settings.Extrude.description = Extrudes the block placed by clicking and dragging in a direction you want.
settings.SurfaceDraw.name = Draw
settings.SurfaceDraw.description = Draw blocks where you are looking by clicking and dragging on a block face. The block face used and drag direction determines where drawing will happen.
settings.FastPlace.name = Fast Place
settings.FastPlace.description = Place blocks faster.
settings.Eraser.name = Eraser
settings.Eraser.description = Break blocks faster.
settings.PlaceMode.name = Place Mode
settings.PlaceMode.description = Changes the way you place blocks.
settings.PlaceModeDefault = Default
settings.CyclePlaceMode = Place mode changed to: {mode}
