legend.PasteTool.Page1.LoadPrefabOrCopy = Load a prefab or copy a selection
legend.PasteTool.Page1.UseSelectionContents = To use the contents of a selection, make a selection using the selection tool and type "/copy" then come back to the paste tool to use your copy
