legend.TintBrush.Page1.Title = Tint Brush
legend.TintBrush.Page1.Description = Allows you to paint or blend tints on blocks.
legend.TintBrush.Page1.BlendTints = Blend the tints where you're aiming
legend.TintBrush.Page1.PaintTints = Paint your color where you're aiming
legend.TintBrush.Page1.PickColor = Copy tint from target
legend.TintBrush.Page1.UndoLastBrush = Undo last brush action
legend.TintBrush.Page1.RedoLastUndo = Redo last undone action
legend.TintBrush.Page1.EditInventoryProperties = Edit color, opacity, size, shape from the inventory
legend.SculptBrush.Page1.Title = Sculpt Brush
legend.SculptBrush.Page1.Description = Allows you to raise and lower the terrain to more accurately sculpt and blend shapes. Supports most features of the Paintbrush.
legend.SculptBrush.Page1.MeltAwayBlocks = Melt away blocks where you are aiming, layer by layer
legend.SculptBrush.Page1.RaiseLayer = Raise a layer of blocks where you're aiming
legend.SculptBrush.Page1.Smooth = Smooth rough terrain
legend.SculptBrush.Page1.MaterialSelectedDescription = When a material is selected, places a layer of that material where you're aiming
legend.SculptBrush.Page1.SelectTargetMaterial = Select targeted material
legend.SculptBrush.Page1.UndoLastBrush = Undo last brush action
legend.SculptBrush.Page1.RedoLastUndo = Redo last undone action
legend.SculptBrush.Page1.EditInventoryProperties = Edit materials, size, shape, and other properties from the inventory
